WEBVTT

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.990
<i>In the darkness</i>

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.200
<i>it starts, now we start.</i>

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.160
<i>Curtains of ruthlessness</i>

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:22.290
<i>stain this world in darkness.</i>

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:26.170
<i>Eternal night comes</i>

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:29.420
<i>writhing with hideous ones.</i>

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:33.340
<i>Gears of fate.</i>

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:36.340
<i>Look, they've begun turning.</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:40.600
<i>The forbidden grimoire.</i>

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.520
<i>Grimoire, grimoire, grimoire.</i>

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:19.470
<i>The clock of destruction</i>

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>engraves times of atrocity.</i>

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:26.560
<i>Silent snares</i>

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:29.690
<i>nobody can ever escape.</i>

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:33.650
<i>Born in secret,</i>

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:36.820
<i>a tale shadows whisper.</i>

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:40.830
<i>Dance in the abyss of Hell.</i>

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:43.620
<i>Now, the curtains rise.</i>

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:51.040
"Depravity and the Forbidden Quadrille"

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:07.270
Morning, Ritsuka.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:11.940
Morning, Mom. Didn't get enough sleep again?

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:15.650
Yeah, my deadline's soon.

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:17.570
Don't overdo it.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.660
The weather's great today, too!

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.260
Let's eat.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:41.760
I'll make dinner tonight, too.
I don't have work.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:46.350
Thanks! I'll finish the manuscript today.

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:48.810
Are you translating for a magazine this time?

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:51.270
Yeah, about British fantasy.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.150
Wow.

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:57.070
Coming.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:04.780
Morning! More like "good evening"
in London, right Big Brother?

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:06.200
Oh, is it Lindo?

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:10.420
Yup, I'm fine! I'll let you talk to Mom.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:16.210
Okay, I'm leaving now.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.380
Oh, wait. It's Monday.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:19.670
Oh.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:24.760
There!

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:29.930
Sometimes I think it's adorable
how you like these charms.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:35.190
Adorable? They're very important, you know.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.690
Of course, Mom.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.240
Have a good day.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.500
Bye, Mom!

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:09.100
♪ Chatting with friends, cream puffs,
and herb tea are all things I like. ♪

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:16.980
♪ Today's the same as yesterday.
I'm a normal high school girl. ♪

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:30.910
♪ I'm not a kid anymore, so I know
that glass slippers, castles, and princes ♪

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:34.370
♪ are all just fairy tales. ♪

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:44.630
♪ But sometimes I wonder,
in the wind after I turn the corner, ♪

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:56.100
♪ if there's a new world. Yes, that there's
someone smiling and waiting for me. ♪

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:08.620
Ritsuka! Morning.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:10.870
Morning, Azuna.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:15.040
Hey, did you finish the
English composition homework?

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:17.000
I got my mom to help me.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.250
I knew it! Help me.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.090
--Mm, maybe--
--Ritsuka!

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:21.920
Hm?

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.630
What did you do?

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.260
Huh?

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:28.260
Urgent Notice: "Ritsuka Tachibana, second year class D, report to the third library immediately."
Student Council President, Rem Kaginuki

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:31.760
What?! The Student Council
President is summoning me?

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.390
Wh-Why?

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:35.140
Ritsuka, what's going on?

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:38.230
Huh? That's what I want to know.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:43.320
But, it's a summons from the
Great Rem. You really don't know?

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:46.150
No, I haven't done anything...

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:47.570
It's her.

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:48.990
She broke the rules or something?

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:50.870
Doesn't look like the type to do that.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:52.790
Oh, but I'm a little jealous.

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:55.450
Right? A summons from the Great Rem.

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:58.170
I'd like to go to the third library, too!

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:00.960
Hey, are you okay, Ritsuka?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.920
Yeah. Anyways, I'll go see what they want.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.270
The third library...

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:35.620
♪ Give up, checkmate. It's time to confess. ♪

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:36.450
♪ Say yes! ♪

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:41.330
♪ Come along, lovely butterflies.
I'll enchant you with a sigh. ♪

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.380
♪ We love your sweet soul! ♪

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:49.050
♪ You'll become mine. Leap and embrace you. ♪

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:50.260
♪ Kiss you! ♪

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:57.220
♪ Poor little you. I'll break you gently. ♪

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:02.100
♪ Worship us. ♪

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.560
♪ Everybody's hearts ♪

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.520
♪ will be stolen. ♪

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.070
♪ To the ends of eternity ♪

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:08.280
♪ they fall. ♪

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.820
♪ Charmingly ♪

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.530
♪ Sweetly ♪

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:16.120
♪ Labyrinth of depravity. ♪

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:24.040
♪ We are Shiko Academy's
Student Council of the third library. ♪

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:27.000
♪ We'll bless those who come ♪

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.800
♪ and bestow a seal. ♪

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:37.350
♪ The forbidden flower garden,
Shiko Academy's Student Council. ♪

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:40.350
♪ You can't run now ♪

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:43.980
♪ from our captivating charm. ♪

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.050
Ritsuka Tachibana?

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.010
Oh, yes.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:16.850
I'm Rem Kaginuki, president of
Shiko Academy's Student Council.

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:24.940
We received a note that
you're violating school regulations.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:28.730
What?! I've done no such thing.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:32.780
I only know what the letter says.
Anything else, I'd need to look into.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:35.660
I haven't gone against school regulations!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:39.120
Who wrote the note? What does it say?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:43.660
I'm the one asking questions here.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:47.000
I should get a say in this, too!

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:50.550
Very good. This butterfly's talking back at you.

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:52.340
Interesting!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:55.180
How exciting.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:59.890
Ritsuka Tachibana. You're quite intriguing.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.330
"Feedback Submission Form"

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:38.220
Actually, I summoned you to ask you something.

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:09.500
Oh.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.590
Hm?

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:17.090
Anyway, I haven't broken any school rules.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:19.090
E-Excuse me.

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:26.430
What a surprising pendant.

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:31.020
Seems she's unaware, poor thing.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:35.190
Looks like it'll be harder than we thought, Rem.

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.940
It won't be a problem.

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:45.790
Next time, we'll checkmate.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.290
"King"

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:53.210
Ugh, what was that about? Geez.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.050
Ritsuka!

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:56.260
Azuna.

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:57.760
How was it?

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:02.470
The nerve! They said I was going against
school regulations without giving me any say!

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:03.930
What?

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:06.970
Everybody gets all googly-eyed
when they see the Great Rem.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.810
I can't believe this is what he's really like.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:12.150
Is it okay, though?
They won't summon you anymore?

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:14.610
Even if they do, I'm won't go.

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:17.110
Let's go.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:00.440
Huh?

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.530
What?

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:12.620
This is terrible.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:22.630
Oh!

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:35.730
Hm?

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.190
It's in the other room.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.580
Ritsuka!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.370
Oh!

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.420
Mom!

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:00.550
Don't!

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:15.230
Th-The police!

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.520
What?

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:31.290
What's the meaning of this?

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.700
Um...

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:35.540
Uh, this is...

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:38.000
You reported there was damage.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.920
Yes, but...

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:50.550
You said thieves entered, right?

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:52.560
And that they got your mom.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:55.890
Yes! The room was all messed up--

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:05.990
How?! How did it--

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:08.860
How? That's what I'd like to ask you.

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:11.120
Well, I'm glad everything's fine.

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.410
But, my mom!

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.200
She probably just went out.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:16.250
It can't be! She was bleeding...

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:19.710
How about you contact us
again if she doesn't come back?

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:21.710
Please, wait!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:23.920
Wait...

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:41.400
Mom!

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:46.650
The number you have reached
is out of range or turned off--

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:56.160
Did they take her?

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.920
Hello? Ritsuka?

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:08.590
Big Brother!

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:09.590
What's wrong?

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:11.260
It's Mom...

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:17.520
I'll go home right away.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:21.770
Stay at your friend's house until
I'm back. Was your friend Azuna?

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:26.570
Huh? But I should be home if Mom comes back.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:30.240
No! Those men might return.

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:35.030
Ritsuka, don't lose your pendant.

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.450
Huh?

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.260
Azuna!

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:56.720
"To Mom: I'm at Azuna's.
Contact me when you come back! --Ritsuka"

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:57.180
Anyway, come over right away.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:59.100
Should I meet you on your way over?

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.350
No, it's okay.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.050
You guys are...

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:32.420
Wh-Where's my Mom?

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:49.820
Where's the forbidden grimoire?

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.150
Tell me.

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:56.070
Ow, my eyes...

00:16:57.450 --> 00:16:58.780
Why?

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:03.960
Damn, it's verbena.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.550
Let go of her.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:16.430
You're not going to stop me.

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:26.480
What? What's going on?!

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:02.470
Oh! It's Rem.

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:06.140
They ran off.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:11.820
U-Um... Thank you very much.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:16.820
I... I...

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:19.910
Huh?

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:26.200
Wh-What is it?

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:30.790
No, it's nothing.

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:35.630
This fragrance...

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:58.030
I don't understand.

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:06.160
The house was back to normal and
the police wouldn't believe me about my mom.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:10.580
It was them. The people from
earlier ransacked my house...

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:13.840
Then, they tried to carry you off?

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:19.670
Yes. They asked me where
the forbidden grimoire is.

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:21.800
The forbidden grimoire?

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:25.010
A grimoire is a book of magic, right?

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:27.930
Why would they ask me?

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:30.640
I don't get it...

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:35.520
Do you know what a grimoire is?

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:40.280
My deceased grandfather studied ethnology.

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:46.540
He studied folklore about
European necromancy, magic, and vampires.

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:49.160
So, I know a little.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.670
Welcome home, Master Rem.

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:08.220
This is just a guess, but I think your house
being ransacked, your mother's disappearance,

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:13.440
and the disturbances at school are related.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.690
Disturbances?

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:20.940
It seems there are students
who are devil worshippers.

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.740
Devil worshippers?!

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:26.370
The note said you were involved.

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.950
No, I don't know anything about it!

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:35.250
They may think the grimoire is in your house.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:40.010
It's not! I've never heard of that!

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:48.510
Um, I'll go talk to the police again.
I need them to help my mom.

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.100
I'll contact them.

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:55.690
--Huh?
--They'll listen if it's someone
from the Kaginuki family.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.650
Um...

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:07.240
Thank you very much for helping me...
and for even helping my mom.

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:13.870
Don't get the wrong idea.
I'm not doing this for you.

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:18.750
I just want to keep order in our
school as Student Council President.

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:30.100
Oh.

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:35.940
Where'd you come from?

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:38.520
Come here.

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:27.880
Do you know where it might be?

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:30.220
My grandfather's house...

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:31.340
This is my mom's!

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:33.930
She was here!

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:36.260
Checkmate.

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:41.060
"Doubt and the Secret Jitterbug"

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:39.640
Act two, "Doubt and the Secret Jitterbug."
